# Web App (`@my-barber/web`)

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, **static export** (`output: 'export'` in `next.config.ts`).
- Tailwind v4 CSS-first: `@import "tailwindcss"` in `globals.css`, `@theme inline` tokens — no `tailwind.config.*`.
- Path alias: `@/*` → `./src/*`.
- Transpile workspace packages: `@my-barber/types`, `@my-barber/config`.

## Conventions

- **Server Components by default** — no `"use client"` unless interactivity requires it.
- Named exports for layout chrome: `Header`, `Footer`, `Hero`.
- Constants from `@my-barber/config`: `APP_NAME`, `SUPPORT_EMAIL`, `SITE_URLS`.
- Per-page `Metadata` export; root layout uses title template `%s · ${APP_NAME}`.
- Dark mode via `prefers-color-scheme` (system preference, not class toggle).
- Fonts: Geist via `next/font/google`.

## Scope

- Landing + legal/contact pages only. No API calls, no auth, no middleware.
- Keep pages thin; compose from `src/components/`.
- Build: `next build --webpack` (required for static export with workspace packages).
